rx10:{o:["The explanation was too short.","A later observation contradicted it.","The narrator disliked the scientist.","The experiment was never conducted.","The weather was unusually warm."],a:1,e:"Finding matching marks in a sealed chamber challenged the original explanation.",p:"At first, the unusual marks on the cave wall were thought to have been made by modern visitors. The explanation seemed plausible because the marks were close to the entrance. Months later, however, researchers found the same distinctive pattern deep inside a sealed chamber that had not been accessible for decades. They began to reconsider the original explanation."},
